  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development Existing: Continued use as&nbsp;Scouts and the Swaminarayan Gurukul Rajkot site (Use Class F1).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The use of the site as a Scout Hut would fall within Use Class F2 which differs to the use as a Hindu Temple under Use Class F1 and is therefore materially different to the existing use and would therefore be considered&amp;nbsp; development under Section 55(2)(f) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). Therefore, planning permission would be required for the dual use as a combined Scout Hut and a Hindu Temple.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The information submitted has failed to demonstrate to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that, on the balance of probabilities, the land has been in combined use as a Scout Hut and Hindu Temple for a continuous period of ten years prior to 02/08/2025.&amp;nbsp; As such, the application would not meet the requirements of S191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). Therefore, planning permission would be required for the dual use of the site as a Scout Hut and Hindu Temple.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
